// Source of the `orchard` kit (tools/town/kits/orchard.json, #3388): the apple and plum orchard on the Saint-Philippe town edge, beside the farm barn
// b100. Coordinates are in the barn's frame (origin = its footprint centre; the kit's front is "+z", so the frame is the world turned by the barn's
// own yaw: x east, z north). Four apple trees and three plum trees (the capped gather spots, #2409; the prefabs carry LF_GatherAction) stand in two
// columns east of the barn on the open grass inside the garden fence; the juicer stands on a plank stall that works as its lean-to against the
// barn's back wall, the sign and a tally desk (the Workplace, kind FARMER) stand at the stall's front, and fruit crates, a hay bale and a hand cart
// dress the path between the stall and the trees.
